# The build context of packages/rafa-hub/Dockerfile, which is the
# repository root: the Dockerfile copies the workspace manifests and then
# the folders of the hub's packages by name, so leave out what the host
# installed or built inside them, the git history, the loop's own state and
# any local secrets, so the image's `bun install --frozen-lockfile` links
# the hub's graph from the lockfile alone and no host `node_modules` lands
# over it.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/.tsbuild
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
.git
.rafa
.ralph
.tmp
.claude/settings.local.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
progress.txt
